Fetched 2026-07-13 through the Wikimedia REST API, one article per language, and converted to a
faithful Markdown rendering. `corpus/v2/*.meta.json` records the source URL, the fetch timestamp and
the character count for each — those files are the provenance record, and this table is read from
them rather than typed:

